BT 1 0 0 1 0 42.5 Tm /F2 10.5 Tf 13.25 TL (Consider an old file containing a floating-point column. Two producer processes save the same values, one as) Tj T* (float32 and the other as float64. Their complete files are identical \(Figure 1\). An evaluator that requires each) Tj T* (original width asks the reader to distinguish inputs it cannot distinguish. Yet accepting any successful load is too) Tj T* (weak: a reader can silently narrow a type or discard a later mutation.) Tj T* ET
