BT 1 0 0 1 0 42.5 Tm /F2 10.5 Tf 13.25 TL (Historical-data repair needs an explicit acceptance contract. The test-oracle problem [1] is concrete here: which) Tj T* (information survives, which behavior must remain usable, and which alternative outputs are legitimate? Lost) Tj T* (numeric width may permit widening; ambiguous authorization may require rejection. We package these decisions) Tj T* (with executable checks.) Tj T* ET
