BT 1 0 0 1 0 23.5 Tm /F2 8.6 Tf 10.7 TL (Figure 1. Two historical producer states yield the same complete document. Each state self-roundtrips with its original width, but the saved) Tj T* (bytes cannot distinguish them. The pair was found in six targeted producer executions; this is an existence witness, not a collision-rate) Tj T* (estimate.) Tj T* ET
