BT 1 0 0 1 0 42.5 Tm /F2 10.5 Tf 13.25 TL (Each repair task supplies an affected reader, producer source, public examples and a source edit scope. A defect) Tj T* (lineage groups one upstream defect and its fix with the relevant versions. Files and process repetitions extend) Tj T* (coverage; they are not independent bugs. The contribution is eight task bundles, calibrated acceptance boundaries) Tj T* (and completed Gemma evaluations. Table 1 summarizes the resource and original baseline.) Tj T* ET
